    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/furniture-shop-blocks/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Furniture Shop Blocks is a specialised theme designed for furniture stores, home décor shops, interior design businesses, and companies looking to showcase kitchen furniture, living room furniture, bedroom sets, office furniture, custom cabinets, sofas, chairs, tables, wardrobes, and storage solutions with style and efficiency. Ideal for promoting kitchen interior designs, including L-shaped kitchens, U-shaped kitchens, open-concept layouts, and modular kitchen designs, it allows businesses to display modern, contemporary, rustic, and traditional kitchen setups. The theme features high-resolution images, customizable galleries, product carousels, and engaging layouts, making it perfect for highlighting kitchen lighting trends, such as pendant lighting, under-cabinet lighting, and ambient lighting options. Its sleek, responsive, and retina-ready design ensures optimal performance across desktops, tablets, and smartphones, while built-in sections for banners, testimonials, and product showcases enhance customer engagement and conversions. Furniture shops can also leverage marketing tools, social media integration, and e-commerce functionality through the WooCommerce plugin, making it easy to manage inventory, display offers, and grow their online presence effectively."
    },
